  "body": "## What changed\n\nKeep \"Use for this setup\" below the machine list, outside the details scroll area.\nKeep its disabled state and \"Cannot assign\" explanation visible.\nDouble-clicking an eligible machine runs the existing undoable assignment command.\nShow \"Selected: <name> - not yet this setup's machine\" until assignment.\nCheck eligibility after selection changes and against the double-clicked entry.\n\nBefore, with the details scrolled to the bottom:\n\n![Before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/de8f6e13cb3dc6bf9e327c747a8f05ae7ca5ec1f/3776/before.png)\n\nAfter, at the same scroll position:\n\n![After](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/de8f6e13cb3dc6bf9e327c747a8f05ae7ca5ec1f/3776/after.png)\n\n## Cause\n\nThe assignment button lived inside the details scroll area.\nClicking a row only selected it.\nThe pane did not explain that selection left the setup unchanged.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll five structural pins pass:\n\n- `selected_machine_names_the_unapplied_selection`\n- `assign_button_works_after_details_scroll_to_bottom_and_undo_restores`\n- `double_click_assigns_the_clicked_machine_and_undo_restores`\n- `double_click_uses_the_clicked_rows_guard_and_skips_the_mounted_machine`\n- `double_click_refused_machine_does_not_queue_an_assignment`\n\nThe first three pins fail with unchanged upstream production code.\nFor mutation proof, restore the production file from `git show upstream/main:crates/ui/src/egui_app/machines_pane.rs` and rerun each pin with `cargo xtask gate test <pin> --crate camcraft-ui`.\nAll three fail again.\nRestoring the fix makes them pass.\nRemoving only the double-click eligibility guard makes both guard pins fail.\nRestoring that guard makes all double-click pins pass.\nThe gesture helper asserts that egui received a real double-click.\n\nFinal source checks:\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 10 steps pass, zero failures. UI library: 1,542 passed and eight ignored. All eight mapped integration suites pass.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passes.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog`: 39 passed, zero failures, four ignored.\n- `git diff --check`: clean.\n\nFetch upstream before the final quick gate: `1ed0898d3a072a37f487c79b8de4c30f9f77bcee`.\nThat advance changes no touched pane or test function.\nThe branch starts from upstream `3c68dcaf2`.\nOnly the decision record was added after these checks.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe catalog suite passes.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` produces no output.\nNo recorded program or snapshot PNG changes.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNative macOS interaction was not exercised.\nScreenshots use the existing offscreen egui harness.\nThe release-only catalog rebuild/regenerate tests for adaptive-pocket and slots remain ignored (four tests).\nThe heavy gate was not run because the diff touches only the UI pane and its tests.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone found across the four changed paths.\n\nEffort: medium.\n\nChangelog: Keep machine assignment visible while scrolling and support undoable double-click assignment.\n\nFixes #3776\n",
